0.150 0.150 0.200 rg
BT /F3 7 Tf 46.00 509.50 Td (Geometrically, every linear equation in three variables forms a flat plane in 3D space. Finding a simultaneous solution) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.200 rg
BT /F3 7 Tf 46.00 500.00 Td (means finding the exact coordinates where all the three planes intersect at a single point. When the variables are) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.200 rg
BT /F3 7 Tf 46.00 490.50 Td (completely tangled together, guessing is impossible. So how can we systematically untangle them without altering the) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.200 rg
BT /F3 7 Tf 46.00 481.00 Td (answer? That is precisely what Gaussian elimination does.") Tj ET
