0.150 0.150 0.200 rg
BT /F3 7.5 Tf 46.00 603.00 Td ("Why are row operations mathematically legal? Each row is simply an equation.) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.200 rg
BT /F3 7.5 Tf 46.00 592.50 Td (If two statements are true, adding a multiple of one true statement to another creates a new, equally true statement.) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.200 rg
BT /F3 7.5 Tf 46.00 582.00 Td (Because each elementary operation can be reversed by an inverse operation, the solution set is strictly preserved.) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.200 rg
